(7344943, 1147751, 174999, '<td valign="top">Trying to read the lines lolol<br/> <br/>What I like: The processing and how it was black and white. Due to my color deficiencies, black and white make it easy on my eyes and leads me in to what it is supposed to be and I prefer black and white images over color any day.<br/> <br/>What I don''t:<br/>To me, The subject is not strong and I  can not see it to well to find where the  start point should be and where my end look should be leading me. My eyes seemed to dart all over the place trying to lock in on something specific, and it just did not do that here. I wanted one place where I can say yep, there it is, I was all over on this image. The softness of image does not bother me, I think it was having one thing to stick out to make it pop.<br/>I would have given this a 5<br/> <br/>Commenting only because I can''t vote on my phone</td>', 'Trying to read the lines lolol What I like: The processing and how it was black and white. Due to my color deficiencies, black and white make it easy on my eyes and leads me in to what it is supposed to be and I prefer black and white images over color any day. What I don''t:To me, The subject is not strong and I  can not see it to well to find where the  start point should be and where my end look should be leading me. My eyes seemed to dart all over the place trying to lock in on something specific, and it just did not do that here. I wanted one place where I can say yep, there it is, I was all over on this image. The softness of image does not bother me, I think it was having one thing to stick out to make it pop.I would have given this a 5 Commenting only because I can''t vote on my phone', '2015-04-24 10:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
