(7345802, 1147843, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- the color of the fish really pops against the blue of the water<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- nothing is in focus<br/>- not sure if this is a composite shot or multiple exposures or how it was done but I''m having a hard time figuring out what the carpet is suppose to be conveying in this shot.<br/> <br/>Overall: I''m guessing the blur was done on purpose to make it seem like the various components are one- but this picture is too busy for my taste.<br/> <br/>Comments made on phone, score to follow- sorry for any typos.</td>', 'What I like:- the color of the fish really pops against the blue of the water What I don''t like- nothing is in focus- not sure if this is a composite shot or multiple exposures or how it was done but I''m having a hard time figuring out what the carpet is suppose to be conveying in this shot. Overall: I''m guessing the blur was done on purpose to make it seem like the various components are one- but this picture is too busy for my taste. Comments made on phone, score to follow- sorry for any typos.', '2015-04-28 18:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345803, 1147788, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- use of b/w. Excellent use to help show the pattern, texture of fish<br/>- that fish in upper right corner, love that it appears to be looking at the camera<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- focus is a bit soft<br/> <br/>Overall: I love this shot. Excellent. It is so visually interesting.<br/> <br/>Comments made on phone, score to follow- sorry for any typos.</td>', 'What I like:- use of b/w. Excellent use to help show the pattern, texture of fish- that fish in upper right corner, love that it appears to be looking at the camera What I don''t like- focus is a bit soft Overall: I love this shot. Excellent. It is so visually interesting. Comments made on phone, score to follow- sorry for any typos.', '2015-04-28 18:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345804, 1148025, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like<br/>- colors of the fish<br/>- sharpness of the picture<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- the fish''s mouth is open, making for an interesting pose- but it is hard to see that the mouth is open because of the background. Not sure if this is fixable in a photo editor or not<br/> <br/>Overall<br/>- picture is a lovely shot of the fish but I wish his expression popped more.<br/> <br/>Comments made on phone, score to follow- sorry for any typos.</td>', 'What I like- colors of the fish- sharpness of the picture What I don''t like- the fish''s mouth is open, making for an interesting pose- but it is hard to see that the mouth is open because of the background. Not sure if this is fixable in a photo editor or not Overall- picture is a lovely shot of the fish but I wish his expression popped more. Comments made on phone, score to follow- sorry for any typos.', '2015-04-28 18:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345805, 1148034, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- the expression of the fish and framing of the shot<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- picture''s focus is soft<br/> <br/>Overall: I was briefly fooled that the fish were real- but once I saw more than the thumbnail I saw they were stone? Still nicely framed<br/> <br/>Comments made on phone, score to follow- sorry for any typos.</td>', 'What I like:- the expression of the fish and framing of the shot What I don''t like:- picture''s focus is soft Overall: I was briefly fooled that the fish were real- but once I saw more than the thumbnail I saw they were stone? Still nicely framed Comments made on phone, score to follow- sorry for any typos.', '2015-04-28 18:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345806, 1147993, 180366, '<td valign="top">I normally say what I like/don''t like but with this pic I can''t<br/> <br/>It just works! Beautifully sharp, great texture (The saturation is a bit more than I usually like, but again, it works.)<br/> <br/>My favorite of the bunch.</td>', 'I normally say what I like/don''t like but with this pic I can''t It just works! Beautifully sharp, great texture (The saturation is a bit more than I usually like, but again, it works.) My favorite of the bunch.', '2015-04-28 18:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345807, 1148050, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- colors are great<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- focus on fish is soft. Wish shutter speed had been higher... Or perhaps it was from shooting though glass?<br/> <br/>Overall: picture is a bit busy. Nice tank, though.</td>', 'What I like:- colors are great What I don''t like- focus on fish is soft. Wish shutter speed had been higher... Or perhaps it was from shooting though glass? Overall: picture is a bit busy. Nice tank, though.', '2015-04-28 18:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345808, 1147802, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- visually very interesting<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- not sure exactly what I''m looking at<br/> <br/>Overall: sure, I have no idea what this is but it has style and feels moody and I keep coming back to it. I like it.</td>', 'What I like:- visually very interesting What I don''t like:- not sure exactly what I''m looking at Overall: sure, I have no idea what this is but it has style and feels moody and I keep coming back to it. I like it.', '2015-04-28 18:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345809, 1147708, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- the monotone<br/>- the subject- jellyfish are so pretty<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- I can see the corner of the fish tank in the background. The harsh line is distracting from the subject<br/>- focus is a bit soft<br/> <br/>Overall: color is beautiful, But I''m not so fond of the framing/ placement of the subject.</td>', 'What I like:- the monotone- the subject- jellyfish are so pretty What I don''t like- I can see the corner of the fish tank in the background. The harsh line is distracting from the subject- focus is a bit soft Overall: color is beautiful, But I''m not so fond of the framing/ placement of the subject.', '2015-04-28 18:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345810, 1148029, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- beautiful colors<br/>- nice focus, DoF nicely done.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- image is a tad too sharp, halos are visible around the fish<br/> <br/>Overall: editing is off a bit<br/> <br/>Comments made on phone, score to follow- sorry for any typos.</td>', 'What I like:- beautiful colors- nice focus, DoF nicely done. What I don''t like:- image is a tad too sharp, halos are visible around the fish Overall: editing is off a bit Comments made on phone, score to follow- sorry for any typos.', '2015-04-28 18:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345811, 1147754, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- exposure looks great<br/>- visually interesting<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- set up, everything is partially cut out of the frame. I can''t really pit into words why this bothers me, but it does.<br/> <br/>Overall: that said- not sure if this picture would be better with everything in frame. This picture doesn''t excite me.</td>', 'What I like:- exposure looks great- visually interesting What I don''t like- set up, everything is partially cut out of the frame. I can''t really pit into words why this bothers me, but it does. Overall: that said- not sure if this picture would be better with everything in frame. This picture doesn''t excite me.', '2015-04-28 18:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345812, 1147883, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like<br/>- reflection of the child<br/>- has je ne sais quoi<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- child''s foot is cut out of frame<br/>- overhead lighting. If this was candid, no way to help that... But if staged, an assistant with a diffuser screen would have been nice, I think, to cut down on some of the overhead light.<br/> <br/>Overall: lovely shot of childhood wonder.</td>', 'What I like- reflection of the child- has je ne sais quoi What I don''t like- child''s foot is cut out of frame- overhead lighting. If this was candid, no way to help that... But if staged, an assistant with a diffuser screen would have been nice, I think, to cut down on some of the overhead light. Overall: lovely shot of childhood wonder.', '2015-04-28 18:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345813, 1147978, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- the set up/ idea of this shot.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- while the imposter pops in this scene, the actual fish does not. Focus on real fish is also blurred.<br/> <br/>Overall: position of the live fish makes it take up very little of the frame and therefor a bit hard to see.</td>', 'What I like:- the set up/ idea of this shot. What I don''t like- while the imposter pops in this scene, the actual fish does not. Focus on real fish is also blurred. Overall: position of the live fish makes it take up very little of the frame and therefor a bit hard to see.', '2015-04-28 18:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345814, 1147789, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like<br/>- this is a neat shot, live all the refections on the glass<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- wish framing was a bit different. I think it looks better if some of the left side us cropped so that the glass isn''t dead center in the shot<br/> <br/>Overall: nicely done. Looks like an advert for PETA or an environmental group.</td>', 'What I like- this is a neat shot, live all the refections on the glass What I don''t like- wish framing was a bit different. I think it looks better if some of the left side us cropped so that the glass isn''t dead center in the shot Overall: nicely done. Looks like an advert for PETA or an environmental group.', '2015-04-28 18:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345815, 1147702, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- the setting, wherever this was taken, it looks gorgeous! <br/>- light is very pretty<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- I am more visually interested in the scenery around the fish than the fish. I love those green shutters!<br/> <br/>Overall: for me this shot is attention grabbing for the background rather than the subject</td>', 'What I like:- the setting, wherever this was taken, it looks gorgeous! - light is very pretty What I don''t like- I am more visually interested in the scenery around the fish than the fish. I love those green shutters! Overall: for me this shot is attention grabbing for the background rather than the subject', '2015-04-28 18:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345816, 1147946, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- the stripes/ spots on the fish and the texture of the fish''s scales work great in b/w.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- whatever effect was used to make this look like an old scratched up print. <br/> <br/>Overall: I didn''t like the framing at first, wishing the fish wasn''t cut out in the crop. But I like it the more I look. This one is growing on me.</td>', 'What I like:- the stripes/ spots on the fish and the texture of the fish''s scales work great in b/w. What I don''t like:- whatever effect was used to make this look like an old scratched up print.  Overall: I didn''t like the framing at first, wishing the fish wasn''t cut out in the crop. But I like it the more I look. This one is growing on me.', '2015-04-28 18:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345817, 1147762, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- the net really pops here with a good focus/ sharpness on the net''s details<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>-this picture just isn''t visually interesting to me. <br/> <br/>Overall: I can see the net and water but I just don''t have an emotional connection to it.</td>', 'What I like:- the net really pops here with a good focus/ sharpness on the net''s details What I don''t like:-this picture just isn''t visually interesting to me.  Overall: I can see the net and water but I just don''t have an emotional connection to it.', '2015-04-28 18:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345818, 1147857, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- the colorful paperweight against the grainy wood<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- I can tell it is a paper wait, but can''t make out what it is suppose to be- the title and contest make me think fish- but I don''t see fish<br/> <br/>Overall: perhaps a different angle would make what the paper weight is a bit more obvious.</td>', 'What I like:- the colorful paperweight against the grainy wood What I don''t like:- I can tell it is a paper wait, but can''t make out what it is suppose to be- the title and contest make me think fish- but I don''t see fish Overall: perhaps a different angle would make what the paper weight is a bit more obvious.', '2015-04-28 18:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345819, 1148021, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- I like the idea of this shot: life mirroring art. <br/> <br/>What I don''t like: <br/>- woman''s hand isn''t actually blocking the sunlight (at least not to both eyes) so it makes me believe that this shot is posed. As a posed shot, I think the positioning of the model could be better. Her purse looks strange sitting in mid air<br/> <br/>Overall: great idea but falls a bit flat for me.</td>', 'What I like:- I like the idea of this shot: life mirroring art.  What I don''t like: - woman''s hand isn''t actually blocking the sunlight (at least not to both eyes) so it makes me believe that this shot is posed. As a posed shot, I think the positioning of the model could be better. Her purse looks strange sitting in mid air Overall: great idea but falls a bit flat for me.', '2015-04-28 18:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345820, 1147967, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like<br/>- the framing<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- soft focus<br/>- colors are bland/ could use more pop<br/> <br/>Overall: wondering how this would look as a b/w with focus on bringing out textures.</td>', 'What I like- the framing What I don''t like- soft focus- colors are bland/ could use more pop Overall: wondering how this would look as a b/w with focus on bringing out textures.', '2015-04-28 18:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345821, 1148062, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- use of b/w to bring out texture<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- glare on the glass from flash/ light source.<br/>- glass distortion of fish on lower right.<br/> <br/>Overall: these fish have pizzaz. But I hate how the tank messed with the shot. Would look much cooler if I couldn''t tell they were in a tank.</td>', 'What I like:- use of b/w to bring out texture What I don''t like- glare on the glass from flash/ light source.- glass distortion of fish on lower right. Overall: these fish have pizzaz. But I hate how the tank messed with the shot. Would look much cooler if I couldn''t tell they were in a tank.', '2015-04-28 18:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345822, 1148006, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like: <br/>- beautiful color, this one really jumped at me from the thumbnail view.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- wish the fish wasn''t swimming away from camera.<br/> <br/>Overall: with framing of fish, it appears that he''s in a hurry to get out of the frame. I wish this was zoomed out just a tad.</td>', 'What I like: - beautiful color, this one really jumped at me from the thumbnail view. What I don''t like- wish the fish wasn''t swimming away from camera. Overall: with framing of fish, it appears that he''s in a hurry to get out of the frame. I wish this was zoomed out just a tad.', '2015-04-28 18:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345823, 1147825, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- it''s gruesome, definitely got a reaction out of me. Use of b/w really highlights the death stares of these fish.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- it''s unsettling to look at- and thus an uncomfortable emotion<br/> <br/>Overall: not all pics are meant to make you feel sunshine and happiness. This one feels very cold. Well done.</td>', 'What I like:- it''s gruesome, definitely got a reaction out of me. Use of b/w really highlights the death stares of these fish. What I don''t like- it''s unsettling to look at- and thus an uncomfortable emotion Overall: not all pics are meant to make you feel sunshine and happiness. This one feels very cold. Well done.', '2015-04-28 18:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345824, 1148061, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like;<br/>- idea of this shot. That some minnows have me caught while others flee<br/> <br/>What I don''t like: colors are a bit bland.<br/>- if not for the title I may not have been able to figure out that was a net rather than a piece of garbage.<br/> <br/>Overall: wish framing was such as to better tell that the net is a net.</td>', 'What I like;- idea of this shot. That some minnows have me caught while others flee What I don''t like: colors are a bit bland.- if not for the title I may not have been able to figure out that was a net rather than a piece of garbage. Overall: wish framing was such as to better tell that the net is a net.', '2015-04-28 18:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345825, 1148030, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- full DoF<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- light is harsh on the fishmonger''s face. I can only see what one of his hands is doing and the angle of his head makes it seem like he was interrupted from his work<br/> <br/>Overall: love the idea and framing of this shot but wish it showed more of how the man was preparing the fish. As an action shot it lacks intention for me.</td>', 'What I like:- full DoF What I don''t like:- light is harsh on the fishmonger''s face. I can only see what one of his hands is doing and the angle of his head makes it seem like he was interrupted from his work Overall: love the idea and framing of this shot but wish it showed more of how the man was preparing the fish. As an action shot it lacks intention for me.', '2015-04-28 18:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345826, 1148017, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- it made me laugh: very clever way to play with your supper.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like: no complaints it''s a great shot!</td>', 'What I like:- it made me laugh: very clever way to play with your supper. What I don''t like: no complaints it''s a great shot!', '2015-04-28 18:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7345827, 1147837, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- take on the subject<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- framing<br/> <br/>Overall: there isn''t anything "wrong" with this photo, technically.<br/>I just don''t much care for it. I''d have preferred more of the face to be present.</td>', 'What I like:- take on the subject What I don''t like:- framing Overall: there isn''t anything "wrong" with this photo, technically.I just don''t much care for it. I''d have preferred more of the face to be present.', '2015-04-28 18:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
